<title>USA: Peptor Ltd  IPO withdrawn -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Peptor Ltd  IPO withdrawn -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering in Peptor Ltd was withdrawn due to market conditions, underwriter Credit Suisse First Boston said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Peptor proposed two million shares at an estimated price range of $14 to $16 under the proposed symbol  PEPTF.O on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Peptor manufactures pharmaceuticals.  For the three months ended March 31, the company reported a net loss of $899,000, or $0.16 a share.</p>
</text>
